t: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           海拔：1700 - 1900 米 masl\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           采收处理：2025.11 - 2025.12\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           海运到港：2026.2月\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：蜜处理 Honey process\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味：树莓、血橙、葡萄柚、红布林\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Raspberry, Blood orange, Grape fruit, Red plum\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           今年选到的第一支卡马文迪（终于买到了，听说了3年了），也是目前买过的最贵的一只肯尼亚，怎么说呢，值得一试哈哈哈哈～（司机大佬不要丢我啊），好喝的！很细腻，酸甜和香气都很细腻，但确实是有点小贵嘛；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            特征关键词：红色莓果核果+红色柑橘+酸甜细腻\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n           关于本批次处理简介\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ：鲜果采收后，袋中厌氧过夜到第二天上午10点左右，脱皮后放入发酵中，加入冷水浸泡式发酵5天，然后晒床晾晒至含水率30%左右转入暗房中继续干燥到最终收储干燥程度；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4SZE5l6FJLHTK07rbUHR1ZibV6u3Ic6CHSBTGvIY48sq7OBDpGSYrRODwMzsFVB9mBX16dhUvZI85J0cZswcbCFmoblicribsKyU/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            图片来自counter culture coffee\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于卡马文迪\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            Kamavindi Estate\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            卡马文迪庄园的传\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            承始于John Njiru Mbature和Anna Rwamba在殖\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            民限制下种下第一批咖啡树——当时本地农民被限定最多只能种植100棵。肯尼亚独立后，他们的儿子夫妻俩\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Martin Ireri Mbature和Hellen Mbature购\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            置了更多土地，将庄园规模扩大到7,000棵咖啡树，为下一代接手铺平了道路。现\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            在，第三代Peter Mbature继承了\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            这份勇于创新和前瞻性思考的传承，以生产品质稳定、风味出众的咖啡以及致力于长期合作伙伴关系而闻名。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            庄园目前\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            主要种植 SL28、SL34 和 Ruiru 11，也勇敢尝试少量Gesha；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b65P9nvdibqu9StZXfWJQjCs898gF5O41pN21Tsa6SB109cXJX6cwtfAx8NQyrttb431SUic5CSW5UZIrTbtYCQNxMEu2pQaKyo0/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Kamavindi 是一个安静而专注的生产单元。与多数依赖合作社基础设施的小农不同，这里自主采收、自主处理，使得工艺与质量控制拥有极高的一致性。庄园主要采用传统水洗处理，结合严格的分选和发酵管理流程。发酵时间、水温控制、分级筛选都有明确标准。正是这种长期、稳定、规范的积累，让他们的杯测表现越来越稳定，也逐渐获得更多国际认可。Peter 不仅经营着自家庄园，也在 Embu 及周边地区帮助其他农户提升处理技术，协助他们与市场接轨。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4UibxvQQEt2ibAhBkA56h1iaRAUAXI4RibB13LNGM2GP71fexlZLYCoqWWHel5ibbpfUp8ib7wbmhudc2qIhbiaJFABGKwJFm720om8g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            卡马文迪还创办了自己的出口公司——卡马文\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            迪咖啡实验室Kamavindi Coffee Lab。该公司帮助那些注重品质的小规模种植者更直接地与精\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            品咖啡买家建立联系。2022年，Peter利用一笔来自种子计划（Seeds）的资助，在卡马文迪庄园内建立了一个杯测实验室和培训中心，用于接待那些有志于提升品质的农民和组织。该实验室为种植者提供了一个在专业品控环境中品鉴自家咖啡的空间，帮助他们更好地理解种植和采后处理中的不同变量如何影响咖啡的风味；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b56yoP0Zc1WeZsejA8vKKibic7vPf2IhgUYNGS35vibicF0icgOfic9qIf5sdfI5iaGp5w57HwurVNgibtPQGib24mT0PXylDXA2yQx63w4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           卡马文迪不仅出色地展现了肯尼亚咖啡所蕴含的鲜活风味，更树立了一个典范—它展示了当种植者主动塑造自身供应链、使其更好地体现自身价值观和愿景时，能够达成怎样的成就。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            // 以上部分图片和内容来自于\n           </span>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://counterculturecoffee.com/products/kamavindi?srsltid=AfmBOoodu2TWRV5vF5xM5dkIH4628jqI5StpxZn05a1ZOCdQwLqujAoy\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"counter culture coffee\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             counter culture coffee\n            </span>\n</a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               关于 SL / Ruiru11 / Batian\n              </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               注：以下内容翻译自Sucafina\n              </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               https://sucafina.com/na/news/think-you-know-kenya-coffee-varieties-think-again , 品种信息部分内容来自world coffee research\n              </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               SL的全称是\n              </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                Scott Agricultural Laboratories (SAL)，是由当时英国殖民政府于1903年成立的农业研究机构，这个机构研究发布了现在我们耳熟能详的两个肯尼亚品种SL28和SL34；\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               SL28和SL34仅是SAL在1930-1940年代发布的众多品种中的两个。由于具有深根特性，能最大限度利用稀缺水资源且无需灌溉即可茁壮成长，它们很快成为种植者的首选，替代了早期的波旁品种；\n              </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               SL品种很快遍布肯尼亚全境，尽管比波旁品种更抗咖啡叶锈病（CLR, Coffee Leaf Rust）和咖啡浆果病（CBD, Coffee Berry Disease），但SL品种仍易感这些疾病。随着咖啡产业发展，许多农场面临越来越严重的CLR和CBD疫情困扰。由于肯尼亚每年逢采收季必逢雨季，CBD侵袭成熟咖啡果的问题尤为严重。当肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI, Coffee Research Institute，肯尼亚独立后成立的咖啡研究组织接替SAL，地点在Ruiru镇）于1985年推出Ruiru11品种时，咖啡产业已做好变革准备。这种卡蒂姆与SL品种的杂交体兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，且种植密度远高于SL品种，能高效利用小面积土地。\n              </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;caret-color: rgb(0, 45, 49);color: rgb(0, 45, 49);font-family: \"Ideal Sans SSm A\", \"Ideal Sans SSm B\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18.4px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);float: none;display: inline !important;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               Ruiru11逐渐在肯尼亚咖啡种植区推广开来。唯一的问题是浅根特性使其耐旱性较差，需要更精细的施肥方案。农民后来发现，通过将Ruiru11嫁接至SL植株上，既可利用SL发达的根系，又能获得Ruiru11的高产高抗病性；由于嫁接Ruiru11日益普及，如今肯尼亚大小农场都混种着Ruiru11与SL品种。随着SL树龄老化，更多农庄正转向Ruiru11（或嫁接方案），因其易管理且抗病性强。\n              </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               Ruiru11的谱系构成比较复杂，它的父系血脉来源于两个方向：1-具有抗病能力的\n              </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                Rume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；母系血脉的考量是好打理的矮株和可以较高的种植密度，以及抗病性，最终一小部分Catimor被筛选出来作为母系血脉；\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                Batian 巴天或者巴蒂安，这是肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI）2010年推出的新品种，以肯尼亚山最高峰命名，兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，还具有两年即可结果的早熟优势。虽然因植株结构等问题尚未大规模推广，但其普及度正在上升。\n               </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                Batian是从Ruiru11的父系植株的第五代里筛选出来的，所以它的基因组成即是：\n               </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                 1-具有抗病能力的\n                </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                  Rume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；\n                 </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            关于处理\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           在肯尼亚，处理过程简要如下：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           - 咖农采收鲜果\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           - 采收当天，运送到处理厂；（摩托车，自行车，人力背运都有）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           - 在处理厂，先将鲜果做挑选；当处理厂的质量员批准后才可计重算作售卖；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           -很多小农的鲜果会集中一批进行去皮处理\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           -去皮后的带着果胶的咖啡豆静置发酵（无水）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           -隔天进行水槽中的刷洗\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           -二次浸泡（根据每个处理厂的习惯，可能有不同质量等级的做二次浸泡或者不做）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           -搬运至晒床晾晒\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           -晾晒约2周左右，收储到处理厂的仓库中\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SUmFynsJ8mZibzFwhDyicticjFTXlrJpJcjxiaqDStcT9MwwM2lMkcO9cZksLTz9doiaPlp0z12qhicDzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\" style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4MDQ4MDQ5OA==&amp;mid=2247483997&amp;idx=6&amp;sn=a18ff433ea7f792d4e6a6f3627f6b9d0&amp;chksm=fd577ec0ca20f7d6e696cf212cc39d2ba6d9b0a4a328ad712cc033336dbb1cd22f159001340d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;color: var(--weui-LINK);text-decoration: none;-webkit-user-drag: none;cursor: pointer;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            更详细的内容可以参考文章 产区 | 肯尼亚\n           </span>\n</a>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           更多咖啡豆选购，请关注淘宝店铺哦～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;outline: 0px;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
